            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in Dotstash 2.0.0</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>🚀 Initial release of the SwiftUI app</li>
                    <li>📊 Dashboard with dotfile cards and health status</li>
                    <li>🔍 Diff viewer with unified and side-by-side views</li>
                    <li>🎨 Syntax highlighting for common config files</li>
                    <li>📁 Drag-and-drop support</li>
                    <li>🔄 Live file watching with auto-refresh</li>
                    <li>📤 Export/import for transferring between machines</li>
                    <li>🛡️ Safety features: drift detection and diff-and-refuse</li>
                    <li>🌐 Menu bar integration with badge count</li>
                </ul>
